  "schema:name": "Critical Micelle Concentration (CMC) Data Collection",
  "schema:description": "This dataset is derived from the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) publication, \"Critical Micelle Concentrations of Aqueous Surfactant Systems\" (http://doi.org/10.6028/NBS.NSRDS.36). The data was extracted using the AI-driven Data Revival service (http://www.data-revival.com/), then manually enhanced by adding SMILES strings, and finally reprocessed by Data Revival to be fully converted into a machine-readable format for improved accessibility and interoperability.",
